     leap-specific vendor HALs that are declared in the device manifest but are not in
     AOSP's framework matrix, hardware/motorola/vintf, or qcom-caf's vendor matrix.
     All optional: the framework does not require them, it just must tolerate them.
-->
<compatibility-matrix version="9.0" type="framework">
